{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-19T01:03:50.812Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"9b10a973c0f15014325213e5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-19T01:03:50.810Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Implementation and regressions complete: new in-process BM25 exemplar ranking over title/body (deterministic ties by item ids), leakage guards excluding the target, items created after it and evaluation-sample items, optional local qwen3-embedding:0.6b similarity with whole-corpus batching and per-corpus lexical fallback, four-characters-per-token budgeted typed exemplar context, majority-class and kNN-vote baselines beside the with/without-exemplar model arms, and the exemplar setting folded into the calibrated channel key (legacy task/model keys unchanged). Independent behavioural revert proofs, each with only the named function reverted and the source restored byte-for-byte afterwards: (1) eligibleExemplars returned the unfiltered pool -> node --test --test-name-pattern='exemplar eligibility refuses' test/exemplar-retrieval.test.ts fails 0/1; (2) exemplarContext ignored the budget -> 'exemplar context truncates' fails 0/1; (3) similarityOrder lost the id tie-break -> 'bm25 ranking is similarity-ordered' fails 0/1; (4) calibrationKey dropped the exemplar setting -> 'persisted exemplar settings validate' fails 0/1 and 'exemplar calibration identity separates' fails 0/1. All mutants exited 1; no timeouts. Full suite now runs 200/200 tests with unchanged 100 percent statements/branches/functions/lines and zero duplication."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-19T01:03:50.812Z"}],"before_hash":"d1e64b4c81bbd2dc063e39b8479509e9a19c55f3f9550591c96b2cf